# Pin line endings to LF inside the repository.
#
# This working tree lives on a CIFS share that is also reachable from Windows.
# A Windows-side editor rewrote 29 tracked files to CRLF on 2026-08-10, which
# git reported as a ~9,400-line diff that was entirely whitespace and buried a
# real firmware change underneath it. `text=auto eol=lf` makes git normalize to
# LF on commit and check out LF on every platform, so that cannot recur.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never normalize, never try to diff as text.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.pdf  binary

# SDR IQ captures (gitignored, but guard the pattern in case one is ever added).
*.bin  binary
